flowchart TD
    A([Approved replacement cannot be supplied]) --> B{Unreleased and current assigned processor?}
    B -->|No| X[Block conversion]
    B -->|Yes| C[Review case fingerprint, reason and public explanation]
    C --> D{Submitted payment unresolved?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Verify actual received funds or explicitly record funds not received]
    D -->|No| F[Lock and recheck case and financial state]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Review still current and conversion eligible?}
    G -->|No| X
    G -->|Yes| H[Atomically convert; clear preparation and stock holds; retain history]
    H --> I[Block quote acceptance, top-up, preparation, release and delivery]
    I --> J{Complete receipt and settlement authorization?}
    J -->|No| K[Wait for Inventory and processor clearance]
    K --> J
    J -->|Yes| L[Create one refund: approved credit plus verified top-up]
    L --> M[Use existing refund attempts, exact transfer and unique proof/reference]
    M --> N{Transfer completed?}
    N -->|No| O[Keep obligation and recorded attempt for safe retry]
    O --> M
    N -->|Yes| P([Complete refund case; no replacement delivery required])
    Q[Verify paid rejected-order eligibility and receipt of original funds] --> M
